OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CTory candidates must sign pledge to    
OL,5,Cscrap net-zero targets, says Badenoch  
OL,6,GAll Conservative candidates will have  
OL,7,Gto sign a pledge committing themselves 
OL,8,Gto leaving the European Convention on  
OL,9,GHuman Rights and scrapping net-zero    
OL,10,Gemission targets ahead of the next     
OL,11,Gelection, Conservative leader Kemi     
OL,12,GBadenoch has said.                     
OL,14,FUnveiling her "candidates covenant" at 
OL,15,Fan event in the East Midlands,         
OL,16,FBadenoch said both policies were       
OL,17,F"necessary for a stronger economy and  
OL,18,Fa stronger country".                   
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
