OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CGovernment to limit costly legal       
OL,5,Cclaims aimed at silencing              
OL,6,Cwhistleblowers                         
OL,7,GThe government has pledged to change   
OL,8,Gthe law to stop abuse victims,         
OL,9,Gwhistleblowers and journalists being   
OL,10,Gsilenced by spurious legal actions or  
OL,11,Gthreats.                               
OL,13,FStrategic litigation against public    
OL,14,Fparticipation, known as Slapps, are    
OL,15,Foften brought by wealthy individuals   
OL,16,For companies to stifle scrutiny and    
OL,17,Fsuppress matters of public interest.   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
